      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>Tactics</strong> Vghotan opens with Howl of the Hunt and Houndmaster, sending his hounds at casters. He uses Mounted Charge on isolated targets and avoids the party's big melee combatant.</p>\n<p><strong>Mounted Charge</strong> Turn on the Mounted Charge toggle before rolling damage to add the extra 1d6.</p>\n<p><strong>Unhorsed</strong> The first time he drops below 24 HP, apply @UUID[Compendium.cerabonds-degrees-of-success.icewind-dale-2-effects.Item.s61HDgOEyIS6JgQS]{Effect: Unhorsed} and stop using warg jaws and Mounted Charge.</p>\n<p><strong>Loot</strong> @UUID[Compendium.cerabonds-degrees-of-success.icewind-dale-2-items.Item.UA66Be7i1HpF3MXw]{Houndstooth Collar} (worn by his warg), 2d6 gp (7 gp in his inventory).</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Vghotan is the goblin warg-rider captain of the force attacking Targos. The town's defenders garble his name as \"Houndstooth.\" He rides a black warg into battle and runs a pack of half-starved hunting wolves.</p>",
